    "methods_description": "Participants completed three tasks outdoors in a roofed basketball arena: eyes open/closed rest; an auditory oddball task (800 and 1000 Hz tones, silently counting deviants) while standing, walking alone, or walking with the experimenter; and 6-minute walking-with-experimenter blocks in Natural, Control (side-blinders) and Synchronize conditions. The experimenter followed a metronome. Session 1 used active electrodes and session 2 used passive electrodes, in counterbalanced order.",
